	"_comment": "Ringside officials. Three judges are drawn from this pool for every fight. 'fairness' (1-99) decides the PUBLIC band shown before a fight: 70+ is FAIR, 40-69 SO-SO, below 40 WILD (the number itself is never shown). 'likes' is SECRET and never shown in game: how much the judge values attacking (coming forward), defence (slipping and blocking), punches landed (clean, quality shots), punches thrown (work rate), power (damage done) and significant strikes (hard clean shots that hurt; 0 means one counts like any other landed punch). A perfectly neutral judge would be landed 1.0, power 0.6, attack 0.25, defence 0.25, thrown 0.1, significant 0.3. All names are invented.",

